+## Legacy escape hatch
+
+The managed-preference model only knows descriptor-driven rows, so the custom rows of
+the old `AdvancedSettingsFragment` (export/import user data, automatic backups,
+all-files access, browse user data directory, Syncthing Rime profile) are not rendered
+in Compose. The Compose `advanced` page therefore ends with a
+**Classic advanced settings** card that calls `SettingsNavigator.openNative("advanced")`
+(`SettingsRoute.Advanced`). `MainActivity.openNativeSettings` now sends
+`Intent.ACTION_RUN` with the route extra: `ACTION_MAIN` dropped the extra and, while a
+setup page was pending (Fcitx5 not the default IME), detoured through `SetupActivity`.
+
 ## Architecture
 
 - `MainActivity` : `ComponentActivity`, `enableEdgeToEdge()`, `setContent { FcitxSettingsTheme { SettingsApp(...) } }`.
